# The current Chrome extension uses browser-managed user OAuth.
# It does not read this file and must never ship a service-account private key.
# Configure the public Chrome Extension OAuth client ID by replacing the
# deliberate oauth2.client_id placeholder in extension/manifest.json; do not
# put that client ID, an access token, or a client secret in this file.
#
# A future optional backend may add its own documented configuration here. Do
# not place Google access tokens, private keys, or client inventory in this
# repository.
